  </item>
  <item>
    <title>Vol.12 旅行日志 | 湖南贵州拉练记</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/6499d404a5b2b405c6c73d7d</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">6499d404a5b2b405c6c73d7d</guid>
    <pubDate>Tue, 27 Jun 2023 04:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>📑 你将听到｜Shownotes</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="144">2:24</a> 天门山：雾气朦胧，遥探九曲蟠龙（一个迷思：前人是怎么修路的？）</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="591">9:51</a> 绿皮火车上的列车员仿佛在做全世界最快乐的工作</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="933">15:33</a> 凤凰古城里的“流水线景观”拍摄，是谁在制造流行？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1257">20:57</a> 坏天气对恐高患者其实有益：看不到具体的事物，就不会感到恐惧</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1335">22:15</a> 景区宣传也是一种内容包装 -“不就几块石头吗？”</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1438">23:58</a> 梵净山，守得雾开</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1625">27:05</a> 我为什么去相对小众的堂安梯田-肇兴侗寨徒步？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2082">34:42</a> 在荔波小七孔遭遇旅行生涯滑铁卢：孔呢？说好的蓝宝石水体、贵州小九寨呢？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2364">39:24</a> 来贵州一定要品尝VC之王刺梨！</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2651">44:11</a> 贵阳很多店铺里贴着“禁止打牌”的告示。我说你们贵州人是有多爱打牌啊？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2909">48:29</a> 旅行感悟之一：允许一切发生</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3014">50:14</a> 旅行感悟之二：外来者和当地人的生活边界在哪里？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3247">54:07</a> 旅行感悟之三：旅行的意义是知道自己还能以怎样的方式生活</span></p><span></span><p><span>⛰️ 摄影集锦</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fsbxj9_Sg5eQ2AY2k4xwb1FY5AKQ.png"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FhZ7z_3Ajr9M4Wsje83N7dSjzT3Z.png"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FnaF7YeY3juj0iA3c-5fPoen68mR.png"></figure><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><span>天门山</span></li><span></span></ul><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FmC3yxTThfJ3sjsCXec-Le-gaPIo.png"></figure><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><span>凤凰古城</span></li><span></span></ul><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FuogDQM-j-5OClgfsCl_BSPwa_Tu.png"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FmHyCckHom3uE0TUOA1agB_boVNL.png"></figure><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><span>梵净山</span></li><span></span></ul><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fr61sYRpLp-edGFtDe5r9OstLE9f.png"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Frwcry5D8zH5Xt-fRqX5AbFYPXPE.png"></figure><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><span>肇兴侗寨</span></li><span></span></ul><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FknhZK_oKnh80w2V3RCkeA6xsgw4.png"></figure><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><span>荔波小七孔</span></li><span></span></ul><span></span><p><span>🎵 BGM</span></p><span></span><p><span>妳的烟熏到我没关系 - 绿橄榄</span></p><span></span><p><span>📞 Contact me</span></p><span></span><p><span>公众号：春去夏尤清</span></p><span></span><p><span>邮箱：yuangyou@foxmail.com</span></p>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/lp9dqc0uto4Y__UzUHiCJEHYbiJB.m4a" length="57214106" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>00:58:30</itunes:duration>
    <itunes:image href="https://bts-image.xyzcdn.net/aHR0cHM6Ly9pbWFnZS54eXpjZG4ubmV0L0ZnQkpnZkJKZmRKTGxjN0gtOHhvV0lBWG9PTXkucG5n.png"/>
    <itunes:explicit>false</itunes:explicit>
  </item>
  <item>
    <title>Vol.11 年终对谈：关爱自己是第一优先级！</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/63c8c5aa78910ae65c958c64</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">63c8c5aa78910ae65c958c64</guid>
    <pubDate>Thu, 19 Jan 2023 04:23:05 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>🎙 </span><strong><span>谁在表达｜Who are speaking?</span></strong></p><span></span><p><strong><span>主播</span></strong><span>：宇昂，不喜欢旅行的互联网人不是好摄影师。</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>嘉宾</span></strong><span>：鸭梨，我的高中好友，即将入职药企做管培生。</span></p><span></span><p><span>📑 </span><strong><span>你将听到｜Shownotes</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="138">2:18</a> 鸭梨：很多朋友觉得我是一个特别适合结婚的人</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="239">3:59</a> 工作与家庭能平衡吗？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="341">5:41</a> 我们怎么理解「贤惠」一词？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="598">9:58</a> 处理关系是成年人的必修课</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="767">12:47</a> 爸妈给我打了20多个电话就是为了给我介绍男孩子</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="945">15:45</a> 工作以后社交圈真的小了好多！（虽然本来也不大）</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1276">21:16</a> 拒绝拧巴，优先关注自己的需求</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1529">25:29</a> 大家都自带保护色，认识一个新朋友的成本其实很高</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1788">29:48</a> 不管是否生育，重要的是我们拥有选择的自由</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2105">35:05</a> 家庭主妇是一份需要获得高薪的职位！</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2249">37:29</a> 宇昂：切西葫芦的时候，感受到心流体验</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2320">38:40</a> 承认吧，过去的工作并没有什么成就感（但我还有相机📷！）</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2600">43:20</a> 鸭梨：22年的关键词是「幸运」</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3101">51:41</a> 暂时找不到方向怎么办？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3335">55:35</a> 23年有什么计划？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3566">59:26</a> 不管怎样都希望保持对世界的好奇！</span></p><span></span><p><span>🎵 </span><strong><span>BGM</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>Candy Wrappers - Summer Salt</span></p><span></span><p><span>📞 </span><strong><span>Contact me</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>公众号：春去夏尤清</span></p><span></span><p><span>即刻：AfterEudaimonia</span></p><span></span><p><span>邮箱：yuangyou@foxmail.com</span></p><span></span><p><span>祝大家兔年快乐、兔飞猛进！🐇</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FnlyQKKqgX2KePV5EhHphmpIi7eJ.jpg"></figure>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/lmojjOTHolES8zXfc3KWEvOgc3B5.m4a" length="62865308" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>01:04:19</itunes:duration>
    <itunes:image href="https://bts-image.xyzcdn.net/aHR0cHM6Ly9pbWFnZS54eXpjZG4ubmV0L0ZxRVdsUmV5UmdHb1NWdXVHMnNNdnQtWVh2RlkucG5n.png"/>
    <itunes:explicit>false</itunes:explicit>
  </item>
  <item>
    <title>Vol.10 工作与生活是协作关系，都是为了塑造自己</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/62a59147d02ea2b34ca88a0f</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">62a59147d02ea2b34ca88a0f</guid>
    <pubDate>Sun, 12 Jun 2022 07:09:58 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>摩托车升级为敞篷车啦，这次邀请到了两位朋友来兜风！🛻</span></p><span></span><p><span>🎙 </span><strong><span>谁在表达｜Who are speaking?</span></strong></p><span></span><p><strong><span>主播</span></strong><span>：宇昂，不喜欢旅行的互联网人不是好摄影师。</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>嘉宾</span></strong><span>：</span></p><span></span><p><span>1.Zoe：某互联网大厂运营。以前开（倒闭）过咖啡馆，当过健身教练、西餐老师，现在仍然相信生活有无限可能。如果大家有健身、做菜上面有疑问，或者对于互联网公司当运营这件事有想了解的部分，能力范围内可以提供一些帮助~</span></p><span></span><p><span>即刻：热爱生活的ZOE君</span></p><span></span><p><span>2.韩老师：心理咨询师，多年大脑研究从业者，来访者方向以个人成长、两性关系、婚姻家庭居多，努力做懂你的人</span></p><span></span><p><span>邮箱：beautifulstella@126.com</span></p><span></span><p><span>📑 </span><strong><span>你将听到｜Shownotes</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="103">1:43</a> 我们最近感到开心的事情</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="360">6:00</a> 听说要解封，我们的反应是...</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="647">10:47</a> Zoe：工作是我认识世界和塑造自己的一种方式，只是顺便把钱赚了</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="912">15:12</a> 韩老师：成为心理咨询师是偶然与必然的结果</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1360">22:40</a> 如何找到自己喜欢的事情？（渣男渣女态度：都试试，不拒绝）</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1544">25:44</a> 感受驱动，追寻那些有正向反馈的事情</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1795">29:55</a> 别被动机限制了选择，万事皆体验</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1969">32:49</a> 如何应对同侪压力（peer pressure）？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2552">42:32</a> Zoe：工作不是生活的对立面，它们都是为了塑造我这个人</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2624">43:44</a> 韩老师：想明白工作是用什么换什么</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2963">49:23</a> 职业规划是个伪命题吗？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3610">1:00:10</a> 隔离这几个月，我们在心态上经历了哪些转变？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4260">1:11:00</a> 在动荡的疫情时代，怎么保持生活的秩序感？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4570">1:16:10</a> 如何对抗孤独感？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4836">1:20:36</a> 我们想怎样度过这一生？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="5322">1:28:42</a> 疫情让我明白，不要给自己太大压力，要重视自己的感受</span></p><span></span><p><span>🎵 </span><strong><span>BGM</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>Angle Number</span></p><span></span><p><span>📞 </span><strong><span>Contact me</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>公众号：春去夏尤清</span></p><span></span><p><span>即刻：AfterEudaimonia</span></p><span></span><p><span>邮箱：yuangyou@foxmail.com</span></p>]]></description>
