  <item>
    <title>Vol.9 对话小张：读书不是对抗无常的武器，它就是生活本身</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/627aa5e115976230f2000f6f</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">627aa5e115976230f2000f6f</guid>
    <pubDate>Wed, 11 May 2022 04:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>🎙 </span><strong><span>谁在表达｜Who are speaking?</span></strong></p><span></span><p><strong><span>主播</span></strong><span>：宇昂，不喜欢旅行的互联网人不是好摄影师。</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>嘉宾</span></strong><span>：小张，master在读，阅读狂/买书狂，电影/旅行爱好者。上刀山做自己，随性而精彩。</span></p><span></span><p><span>📑 </span><strong><span>你将听到｜Shownotes</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="78">1:18</a> 小张的研究方向</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="300">5:00</a> 我们最近感到快乐的事情</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="615">10:15</a> 所有等待的时间都在读书</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="754">12:34</a> 从小到大的读书之旅</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="911">15:11</a> 人生的功课终究要自己去修炼</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1085">18:05</a> 我们为何而读书？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1200">20:00</a> 如何发现一本书？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1301">21:41</a> 会做读书笔记吗？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1429">23:49</a> 纸质书与电子书</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1579">26:19</a> 看书与买书的有机结合</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1860">31:00</a> 读书是让自己放松和有效思考的过程</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1967">32:47</a> 那些「阅读困难」的时刻</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2168">36:08</a> 喜欢读的类型</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2471">41:11</a> 是不是好书，得读过才有发言权</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2916">48:36</a> 很喜欢一本书的时候，会收藏它的所有版本</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2962">49:22</a> 读言情小说的我们</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3127">52:07</a> 过去一年最喜欢的书</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3338">55:38</a> 甘于接受平凡，但不要平庸</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3448">57:28</a> 如何养成良好的阅读习惯？</span></p><span></span><p><span>📚 </span><strong><span>本期提到的人名/书名</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>伊坂幸太郎 《金色梦乡》</span></p><span></span><p><span>鲍鲸鲸（《失恋33天》编剧）</span></p><span></span><p><span>海桑《我是你流浪过的一个地方》</span></p><span></span><p><span>《李光耀观天下》</span></p><span></span><p><span>《坏血》</span></p><span></span><p><span>《献给阿尔吉侬的花束》</span></p><span></span><p><span>《一个叫欧维的男人决定去死》</span></p><span></span><p><span>《米歇尔·奥巴马传》</span></p><span></span><p><span>《一生的旅程 迪士尼CEO自述》</span></p><span></span><p><span>王xx《海豹和小章鱼》</span></p><span></span><p><span>《下一站火星》</span></p><span></span><p><span>《邓小平时代》</span></p><span></span><p><span>八月长安《最好的我们》</span></p><span></span><p><span>井上靖《天平之甍》</span></p><span></span><p><span>《人类简史》</span></p><span></span><p><span>🎵 </span><strong><span>BGM</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>Oasis - Sitting Here In Silence (On My Own)</span></p><span></span><p><span>📞 </span><strong><span>Contact us</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>公众号：春去夏尤清</span></p><span></span><p><span>即刻：AfterEudaimonia</span></p><span></span><p><span>邮箱：yuangyou@foxmail.com</span></p>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/lqxeXggfQB4MFfqDwpBFjngOymon.m4a" length="64529997" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>01:04:00</itunes:duration>
    <itunes:image href="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FibT0cg51iUHlX-a6pPJ0mQYqiHS.jpg"/>
