  <item>
    <title>Vol.8 对话产品经理奶爸：摘掉头衔，保持开放，拥抱更广阔的生活</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/626386143db96e05d876f723</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">626386143db96e05d876f723</guid>
    <pubDate>Sat, 23 Apr 2022 04:52:36 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><strong><span>Who are speaking?</span></strong></p><span></span><p><strong><span>主播</span></strong><span>：宇昂，不喜欢旅行的互联网人不是好摄影师。</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>嘉宾</span></strong><span>：奶爸，新手爸爸，副业是大厂的产品狗。</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>Shownotes</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="93">1:33</a> 我们最近感到快乐的事情</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="602">10:02</a> 奶爸的工作基本情况</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1001">16:41</a> 听说哈佛建筑系的同学要来我们这工作…</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1272">21:12</a> 越来越卷的大厂招聘，同质化的职场新人</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1710">28:30</a> 热爱生活的人才能做好产品</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1787">29:47</a> 如何建立自己的职场影响力？（欢迎留言，分享你的看法！）</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1866">31:06</a> 互联网行业为什么薪水这么高？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2360">39:20</a> 我们的工作到底卷不卷？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2578">42:58</a> “努力就有回报”并不一定适用于职场</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2929">48:49</a> 我们认可自己的工作吗？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3100">51:40</a> 产品经理就是不断地去解决各种问题</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3743">1:02:23</a> 不要成为需求工具人</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4078">1:07:58</a> 别被产品经理的头衔束缚，要利用工具把事情做好</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4415">1:13:35</a> 被裁员不一定是一件坏事</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4677">1:17:57</a> 大胆开麦：这个行业不需要那么多优秀的人</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4830">1:20:30</a> 不是只有工作上的成长才算成长，你可以走得慢一些</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="5211">1:26:51</a> 如果不做这行了，我们能干啥？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="5367">1:29:27</a> 这次疫情体现了互联网人对数字化的理解</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="5505">1:31:45</a> 去成为驱动行业进步的那个角色</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="5681">1:34:41</a> 对职业选择保持包容</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="6141">1:42:21</a> 宇宙的尽头是考公？这事儿怎么看？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="6614">1:50:14</a> 有没有想过什么时候退休？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="6796">1:53:16</a> 保持耐心，保持开放，定义自己想要的生活</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>BGM：</span></strong><span>dont worry baby</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>Contact us</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>宇昂：</span></p><span></span><p><span>公众号：</span><a href="https://mp.weixin.qq.com/mp/profile_ext?action=home&amp;__biz=MzU0NTk0NDQ3Mg==&amp;scene=124#wechat_redirect" data-url="https://mp.weixin.qq.com/mp/profile_ext?action=home&amp;__biz=MzU0NTk0NDQ3Mg==&amp;scene=124#wechat_redirect"><span>春去夏尤清</span></a><span> 邮箱：yuangyou@foxmail.com</span></p><span></span><p><span>奶爸：</span></p><span></span><p><span>即刻：找个名字用一下 邮箱：nebulaguo@163.com</span></p>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/lgWp5DyxPJqp5ydCcPEcs04lDzf-.m4a" length="115322464" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>01:57:35</itunes:duration>
    <itunes:image href="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FibT0cg51iUHlX-a6pPJ0mQYqiHS.jpg"/>
    <itunes:explicit>false</itunes:explicit>
  </item>
  <item>
    <title>Vol.7 读博令我情绪稳定：与营销系的慧欣聊聊做学问这件事</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/623de3dad485a5cd7767fa80</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">623de3dad485a5cd7767fa80</guid>
    <pubDate>Fri, 25 Mar 2022 15:46:33 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><strong><span>Who are speaking?</span></strong></p><span></span><p><strong><span>主播</span></strong><span>：宇昂，英翻出身，不喜欢旅行的互联网人不是好摄影师。</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>嘉宾</span></strong><span>：慧欣，复旦管院营销系博士在读二年级，目前在加拿大英属哥伦比亚大学交换，研究方向为消费者行为学。</span></p><span></span><p><span>祝大家都能与不确定性共处，过好每一天的生活！</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>Shownotes</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="155">2:35</a> 先聊点轻松的：我们最近感到快乐的事儿</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="420">7:00</a> 嘉宾个人经历介绍</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="577">9:37</a> 营销学的同学们日常如何与企业合作？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="815">13:35</a> 所以，营销学是在研究啥呢？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="963">16:03</a> 如何找到自己的研究方向？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1100">18:20</a> 营销学领域也有“最后一公里”</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1359">22:39</a> 读博的整体感受</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1593">26:33</a> 营销是把用户不需要的东西卖给他们吗？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2371">39:31</a> 聊聊广告</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2834">47:14</a> 博士是为自己打工呀！</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2941">49:01</a> 读博带给我的收获</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3309">55:09</a> 不读书的日子都在做什么咧？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3533">58:53</a> 国内外的学术环境有什么不同吗？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3759">1:02:39</a> 营销学博士毕业后都有哪些选择？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4264">1:11:04</a> 人生真的不止高校和大厂这两个选择！</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4550">1:15:50</a> 在温哥华这个城市求学是一种怎样的体验？</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>BGM</span></strong><span>：Stay Alive</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>Contact us</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>宇昂：</span></p><span></span><p><span>公众号：春去夏尤清 / 即刻：AfterEudaimonia</span></p><span></span><p><span>慧欣：</span></p><span></span><p><span>即刻：hxd50 / 播客：周五晚Friday Night</span></p>]]></description>
