  <item>
    <title>Vol.6 恋爱如夏日烟火，我希望再久一些</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/6149ee1d233a4dd53f55a382</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">6149ee1d233a4dd53f55a382</guid>
    <pubDate>Tue, 21 Sep 2021 14:37:16 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<figure><img src="https://image-qiniu.jellow.site/FkmoKZGXRz3DuOEbb0Rq6z3XT3tG.webp"></figure><span></span><p><strong><span>Who are speaking?</span></strong></p><span></span><p><strong><span>主播</span></strong><span>：宇昂，刚毕业的职场新人，不喜欢旅行的互联网人不是好摄影师</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>嘉宾</span></strong><span>：山梨，93年，虽然是金融出身但觉得咨询才是自己永恒的道路</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>Shownotes</span></strong></p><span></span><h2><strong><span>1. 当我们决定建立一段关系</span></strong></h2><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="205">3:25</a> 爱情是什么？我们为什么要恋爱？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="345">5:45</a> 分享最近建立的一段关系（如何相遇，如何确定关系，对关系的态度和展望）</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="635">10:35</a> 我们愿意和怎样的人在一起？（相似/互补？是否在意年龄/年龄差？物质条件的问题怎么看？）</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="835">13:55</a> 什么是好的爱情？什么是完美伴侣？</span></p><span></span><h2><strong><span>2. 当我们决定结束一段关系</span></strong></h2><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1020">17:00</a> 什么时候该果断退出？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1128">18:48</a> 有受过情伤吗？当时是什么情况，花了多久走出来？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1300">21:40</a> 这段关系给我们带来了哪些影响？收获了哪些经验教训？</span></p><span></span><h2><strong><span>3. 恋爱课题中的反复探询</span></strong></h2><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1535">25:35</a> 相不相信一见钟情？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1650">27:30</a> 怎样判断对方究竟喜不喜欢我？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1789">29:49</a> 如何增强自己的吸引力？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1963">32:43</a> 怎样应对异地恋的考验？</span></p><span></span><h1><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2060">34:20</a> 究竟有没有「对的人」？</span></h1><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2228">37:08</a> 谈恋爱这事儿是玄学嘛？用星座或MBTI等工具来判断双方的匹配程度，靠不靠谱？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2322">38:42</a> 另一半太受欢迎/比我优秀太多，会自卑吗？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2408">40:08</a> 在恋爱中是否曾对别人心动过？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2471">41:11</a> 爱情最终会变成亲情吗？如何保持新鲜感？</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>4. 总结</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2550">42:30</a> 我们对于谈恋爱该抱着怎样的心态？</span></p><span></span><p><span>知道自己想要一段怎么样的关系，尽情享受，不要想太多！</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2672">44:32</a> 如何经营一段高质量的亲密关系？</span></p><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><span>多读书，了解人性，了解自己和对方，不断修正</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>真诚、坦荡、高频次、有深度的沟通</span></li><span></span></ul><span></span><h2><strong><span>Contact us</span></strong></h2><span></span><h1><span>宇昂：</span></h1><span></span><h1><span>Email：yuangyou@foxmail.com</span></h1><span></span><h1><span>微信公众号：春去夏尤清</span></h1><span></span><h1><span>山梨：</span></h1><span></span><h1><span>即刻ID：谢山梨</span></h1>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/lk5NhgOM0h68j_8N5ITVwFZt1XQH.m4a" length="51205625" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>00:52:17</itunes:duration>
