  <item>
    <title>Vol.5 密友36问：想再了解你一点（上）</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/609e962530f14a3465e25ba8</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">609e962530f14a3465e25ba8</guid>
    <pubDate>Fri, 14 May 2021 14:59:51 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>（在餐厅里录的，杂音有点重，先说声抱歉了！）</span></p><span></span><p><span>如果你能在这个世界上选任何人同你共进晚餐，你想邀请谁？</span></p><span></span><p><span>Given the choice of anyone in the world, whom would you want as a dinner guest?</span></p><span></span><p><span>你想出名吗？以怎样的方式？</span></p><span></span><p><span>Would you like to be famous? In what way?</span></p><span></span><p><span>对你来说，怎样算作“完美”的一天？</span></p><span></span><p><span>What would constitute a “perfect” day for you?</span></p><span></span><p><span>如果你能活到90岁，但是在后面的60年里你只能选择保持30岁的身体或者30岁的头脑，你会选哪一个？</span></p><span></span><p><span>If you were able to live to the age of 90 and retain either the mind or body of a 30-year-old for the last 60 years of your life, which would you want?</span></p><span></span><p><span>是否曾经预感过自己会怎样死去？</span></p><span></span><p><span>Do you have a secret hunch about how you will die?</span></p><span></span><p><span>说出三个你和对方具备的共同点。</span></p><span></span><p><span>Name three things you and your partner appear to have in common.</span></p><span></span><p><span>你生命中最想感激的是什么？</span></p><span></span><p><span>For what in your life do you feel most grateful?</span></p><span></span><p><span>如果你能改变你成长中的任何东西，你会去改变什么？</span></p><span></span><p><span>If you could change anything about the way you were raised, what would it be?</span></p><span></span><p><span>如果你明天醒来，能获得任意一项品质或者技能，你希望是什么？</span></p><span></span><p><span>If you could wake up tomorrow having gained any one quality or ability, what would it be?</span></p><span></span><p><span>如果有个水晶球能告知关于你自身、你的生活、你的未来或者任何其他事情的答案，你会问它什么？</span></p><span></span><p><span>If a crystal ball could tell you the truth about yourself, your life, the future or anything else, what would you want to know?</span></p><span></span><p><span>是否有什么是你梦想很久但是一直没去做的事情？为什么一直没有去做？</span></p><span></span><p><span>Is there something that you’ve dreamed of doing for a long time? Why haven’t you done it?</span></p><span></span><p><span>在一段友谊中你最珍视的是什么？</span></p><span></span><p><span>What do you value most in a friendship？</span></p><span></span><p><span>如果你知道一年之内你会突然死去，你是否会对现在的生活做出改变？为什么？</span></p><span></span><p><span>If you knew that in one year you would die suddenly, would you change anything about the way you are now living? Why?</span></p><span></span><p><span>轮流分享你认为对方具有的5个好品质。</span></p><span></span><p><span>Alternate sharing something you consider a positive characteristic of your partner. Share a total of five items.</span></p>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/lkWtksTbJfKFOW5NI_8l0aQ05Pa6.m4a" length="102296415" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>01:00:00</itunes:duration>
    <itunes:image href="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fo5DfccO2ejseQhwAZuyaJ_qclep.png"/>
    <itunes:explicit>false</itunes:explicit>
  </item>
